        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Self-destruct"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: The clockwork spy is reduced to 0 Hit Points\n\nA clockwork spy must use this reaction unless specifically programmed otherwise by its creator; ; The spy thrashes around and emits a tinny scream followed by a steady ticking sound. At the beginning of what would have been its next turn, the clockwork spy explodes, dealing 1d10 piercing damage in a 5-foot radius (16 basic Reflex save). Its gemstone is destroyed, along with any information contained inside it. An adjacent creature can cancel the self-destruct sequence by succeeding at a 16 Thievery check to Disable a Device."
            },
